  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>AURA</strong> moderate evocation; <strong>CL</strong> 7th <strong>SLOT</strong> —; <strong>PRICE</strong> 25,000 gp; <strong>WEIGHT</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong><br>\nThese silvery cans are always forged in pairs, and an intangible silvery string that is only visible under the gaze of a detect magic, see invisibility, or similarly powerful magic connects them. Each can can send up to 50+2d10 words to the other per day. This function works across any amount of distance, and even across planes.</p>\n<p><strong>CONSTRUCTION REQUIREMENTS</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, sending; <strong>COST</strong> 15,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-wondrous-items#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
